/E (2. LITERATURE REVIEW )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E (Predicting loan approval using machine learning has gained significant attention in the banking and financial sector, as it helps minimize financial risk and supports more efficient decision-making. Various studies have explored the performance and applicability of different machine learning and statistical techniques for this purpose.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
232 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 128 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
233 0 obj
<<
