518 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 145 0 R
/E (The advanced analysis showed that Logistic Regression was the most suitable model for loan approval prediction among all evaluated machine learning models. The model achieved strong Accuracy, F1-Score, and ROC-AUC results, while the classification report, confusion matrix, and ROC curve confirmed its reliability and predictive capability. Feature importance analysis identified Credit_History as the strongest predictor of loan approval. Overall, the advanced analysis demonstrated that machine learning techniques can effectively support accurate and reliable loan approval prediction.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
